Scope:
- Covered: the author's public editions of the working notes (tc/ch15/notes/),
  the evidence register and preparation record (tc/ch15/), and the repository
  documentation.
- Not covered: third-party material, which is not included and keeps its own
  terms; the book manuscripts (The Forgotten Coordinate and its Technical
  Companion), which are not part of this repository.
- Software: none is included. Any software added later will carry its own
  licence (MIT is intended) and will be marked as such.
